---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Intellectual Property Lawyer in San Francisco | Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Looking for a reliable intellectual property lawyer in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office protects trademarks, copyrights, trade secrets & brands. Call (415) 360-5266."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-gold-bar"></div>
        <span class="hero-page-label">Practice Area</span>
        <h1 class="hero-page-title">Intellectual Property Lawyer in San Francisco</h1>
        <p class="hero-page-subtitle">Your inventions should be safeguarded. Whether you own a start-up, develop software, manufacture goods or are creating a brand identity, there is intellectual property that needs to be safeguarded. If you are looking for a reliable intellectual property lawyer in San Francisco, seek our help to protect what you have worked on and ensure a better future for your business. The Sulfab Law Office is ready to help entrepreneurs, inventors, artists, technology companies, and growing businesses.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-primary">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline">Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="strategic-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="strategic-grid">
        <div class="strategic-sidebar">
          <p class="kicker">Strategic Protection</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Protect Your Ideas, Brand, and Business</h2>
          <div class="gold-bar"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="strategic-content">
          <p>Your intellectual property might become one of the most valuable assets of your company. It can consist of your trademark, brand name, software, creations, inventions, and other confidential information about the business. If the correct protective measures are not taken, this information can be used by other parties without your consent.</p>
          <p>Our team is here to assist you in understanding the intellectual property that you possess and how you can protect it from any risks and dangers. Our clients range from startups, technology businesses, manufacturing firms, healthcare firms, e-commerce companies and creative entrepreneurs.</p>
          <div class="strategic-highlight">
            <p>From reviewing your current IP assets to planning for future growth, an intellectual property attorney in San Francisco can provide practical legal guidance to help protect your work, reduce risks and support your long term business goals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-grid-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services-grid-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">What We Protect</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Intellectual Property Services</h2>
        <p class="services-subtitle">Your intellectual property is not only an idea. It is the backbone of your company's brand, product development and future growth. As a trusted intellectual property law firm in San Francisco, we help businesses protect valuable assets with practical legal solutions that fit their goals.</p>
        <div class="services-detail-grid">
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Trademark Registration</h3>
            <p>To ensure the protection of your company's name, logo, slogans, and other assets related to the brand, proper trademark registration should be carried out.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Copyright Protection</h3>
            <p>Copyright protection helps to safeguard your original works such as software, literary works (books), websites, videos, music, art, and any other creative works.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Protection of Trade Secrets</h3>
            <p>Protect confidential information, including customer lists, formulas, processes and other confidential information.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Intellectual Property Licensing Agreements</h3>
            <p>Create agreements that will allow third parties to use your intellectual property, under terms that protect your ownership rights.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Technology Transaction</h3>
            <p>Assist in the drafting and negotiation of software licensing agreements, technology agreements, and other technology transactions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Management of Intellectual Property Portfolio</h3>
            <p>Assist with organizing and managing your intellectual property portfolio.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="strategic-highlight" style="margin-top: 2rem; text-align: center;">
          <p>We will also be able to provide you with assistance with international protection of your intellectual property.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cards-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Our Approach</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">How We Help Protect Your Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="cards-subtitle">Intellectual property protection is more than simply filing for a trademark or having contracts drafted. It is also crucial for you to understand how these rights play out in your business. Our IP lawyer San Francisco team helps you make clear and informed decisions.</p>
        <div class="cards-grid">
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Understand Your IP Assets</h3>
            <p>We help you determine what IP assets you have – which are the ideas, content, brands, technologies, and other business information that could have legal value.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Create a Protection Plan</h3>
            <p>Since all businesses have different requirements, we help you select methods of IP protection that suit your business and industry needs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Review Ownership Rights</h3>
            <p>Ownership becomes complicated if there are employees, contractors, partners, or outside entities working with you. We analyze these agreements and help establish clear ownership terms.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Support Business Agreements</h3>
            <p>Intellectual property can also be a significant part of your business dealings. We help with preparation and review of license agreements, technology agreements, intellectual property assignments, and various other types of agreements dealing with your intellectual property.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Manage IP as Your Business Grows</h3>
            <p>The needs for your intellectual property can change while growing your business. We manage your intellectual property while your business grows by offering legal services.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="why-us-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Why Choose Us</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Reasons to Select Sulfab Law Office Intellectual Property Lawyers</h2>
        <p class="why-us-subtitle">Our clients are glad about their choice of San Francisco intellectual property lawyers, as we offer practical and business-minded legal advice. Here are some good reasons why businesses work with us for their IP guidance needs.</p>
        <div class="why-us-grid">
          <div class="why-us-item"><h3>Personalized legal advice</h3></div>
          <div class="why-us-item"><h3>Clear and simple communication</h3></div>
          <div class="why-us-item"><h3>Cost-effective legal solutions</h3></div>
          <div class="why-us-item"><h3>Experience with technology and licensing matters</h3></div>
          <div class="why-us-item"><h3>Support for both U.S. and international IP issues</h3></div>
        </div>
        <p class="why-us-subtitle" style="margin-top: 2rem; font-style: italic;">We believe legal protection should be understandable, not overwhelming.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Questions & Answers</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">FAQ</h2>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>What is the difference between a trademark, copyright, and patent?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>A trademark covers names, logos, and slogans. Whereas copyright includes protection for original work like software, literature, films, video games, or music. A patent provides protection for patentable inventions/innovations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>Can trade secrets be protected after the employee's resignation?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes. It is possible to use non-disclosure agreements, limited access and other measures to protect trade secrets.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>Does registering my business name protect my trademark?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>No. Business name registration and a Limited Liability Company (LLC) will not provide you with trademark protection. In that case, separate trademark registration may be required.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <div class="cta-glow"></div>
        <div class="cta-content">
          <div class="cta-text">
            <h2>Get Legal Help for Your Intellectual Property!</h2>
            <p>Intellectual property investments help you secure your business's valuable assets for your future. Whether you run a startup, are developing a new technology, or are expanding your brand, The Sulfab Law Office will provide you with the needed guidance in matters regarding intellectual property.</p>
            <p>Call us now to arrange a consultation and find out how you can legally secure your ideas.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-cta">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
            <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline">Schedule a Consultation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .services-detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .services-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
    .service-detail-item { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius: 0.75rem; background-color: rgba(248,250,252,0.5); }
    .service-detail-item h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .service-detail-item p { color: #475569; font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

    .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background-color: #fff; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .faq-section { padding: 5rem 0; } }
    .faq-content { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; }
    .faq-list { margin-top: 3rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .faq-item { border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgba(248,250,252,0.5); }
    .faq-question {
      width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .faq-question:hover { background-color: rgba(255,251,235,0.3); }
    .faq-icon { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; color: #B45309; flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform 0.3s ease; }
    .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.5rem; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease; }
    .faq-item.open .faq-icon { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .faq-item.open .faq-answer { max-height: 500px; padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem; }
    .faq-answer p { color: #475569; font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
